  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Often followed by an infinitive: *lograr + infinitivo* (\"to manage to / to succeed in doing something\").",
    "*Un extraño acontecimiento logra sacarlo de su aislamiento.* (\"A strange event manages to pull him out of his isolation.\")",
    "*Logramos terminar el proyecto a tiempo.* (\"We managed to finish the project on time.\")",
    "Related: *el logro* (achievement, noun), *conseguir* (near-synonym, \"to achieve/get\"), *alcanzar* (synonym, \"to attain\")."
  ],
